~ start
Mina: Hello, Violet
Mina: What would you like to talk about?
- day  [$> Global.happiness += 10]
- random [$> Global.happiness += 5]
- open up [$> Global.happiness += 30]
	=>< open_up
- ignore

=> END

~ open_up
% 	
	Mina: ... 
	- y'know how I've made new friends?
		Mina: ...
