								Mina: ...
								- idk
									Mina: ...
									- people are confusing...
	Mina: ... [$> Global.expression = 'sad']
	Mina: I'm sorry to hear that, Violet!
	Mina: people ARE really confusing...
	Mina: you're not the first person to think that
	Mina: so don't be discouraged on your venture to make more friends!
	Mina: the fact that you're still trying despite this hurdle shows how strong you are
	Mina: thank you for sharing your worries with me!
	Mina: I'm certain it'll get easier!
	Mina: and you'll always have me to fall back on if things get too hard!
	- thanks, Mina 
		Mina: anytime!
	- ...
% 
	Mina: ...
	- it's 11pm right now
		Mina: ...
		- mum is still out 
			Mina: ...
